WEBVTT

00:20.987 --> 00:26.516
It's amazing that we managed
to get this crew together.

00:26.926 --> 00:29.326
I don't want to be here.

00:29.496 --> 00:32.863
What I really want to do is
beat Rorec to a pulp...

00:32.932 --> 00:34.763
...then go home and sleep.

00:35.568 --> 00:37.058
Don't worry.

00:37.370 --> 00:41.431
Once we get out of the slums,
I'll be your opponent.

00:42.042 --> 00:45.034
Even though we may have
different motives...

00:45.111 --> 00:47.045
...everyone's goal and destination
is the same.

00:47.614 --> 00:49.343
You said it.

00:49.816 --> 00:50.783
There.

00:51.851 --> 00:54.376
So that's the Killing Fields.

00:54.854 --> 00:56.378
Are we ready?

00:56.689 --> 00:57.553
Of course.

00:57.624 --> 00:59.956
We're ready to win, of course!

01:02.562 --> 01:03.426
Let's go!

01:36.096 --> 01:41.932
HEY YOU!
If you keep sulking and
watch the world go by

01:42.302 --> 01:46.864
Nothing will ever happen
So don't run away

01:47.707 --> 01:53.942
If you have a future
that you can run to

01:54.013 --> 02:00.043
There's no time to be depressed

02:00.120 --> 02:06.389
Everyone gets lost
from time to time

02:06.459 --> 02:12.329
But we keep living
every day that we are granted

02:12.398 --> 02:18.530
Things that we must not lose

02:18.605 --> 02:24.635
We must protect
even if we get hurt

02:24.711 --> 02:30.877
Still we can believe
in our strength

02:30.950 --> 02:37.651
To be able to get up
and walk again

02:43.163 --> 02:48.260
Battle - Toward the Zenith

02:55.842 --> 03:00.836
I'll need confirmation of identity from
those who will be participating.

03:13.960 --> 03:15.325
That's good.

03:15.695 --> 03:18.664
Registration of Team Rayon
is now complete!

03:18.831 --> 03:21.425
Now, I'd like to explain the rules...

03:21.501 --> 03:24.834
...of the Underground Fighting
Tournament to you.

03:25.405 --> 03:29.205
Firstly, we would like to state that
we will not be held responsible...

03:29.275 --> 03:31.675
...for any deaths or injuries
that may occur.

03:31.744 --> 03:33.712
Fighting is prohibited
outside the designated area.

03:33.780 --> 03:37.546
The judge's decision is final.

03:38.284 --> 03:41.219
The qualifying rounds are divided
up in Blocks, from A through D...

03:41.287 --> 03:42.777
...and the tournament is organized...

03:42.855 --> 03:44.755
That's enough!
I got it! I got it!

03:45.024 --> 03:48.255
It just means that if we don't lose any
battles, we'll win the tournament right?

03:48.461 --> 03:51.021
Uh, yes. That's right.

03:51.598 --> 03:53.589
Then that's all we need to know.

03:53.933 --> 03:55.457
Let's go, you guys.

03:55.535 --> 03:56.832
Oh, and one more thing...

03:57.170 --> 03:59.866
lf, as a result of death
or other circumstances...

03:59.939 --> 04:02.601
...the number of team players
falls below four...

04:02.675 --> 04:04.643
...you will be automatically
disqualified.

04:04.711 --> 04:06.235
So, please be careful.

04:08.681 --> 04:12.515
You sure say scary things
with a cute smile.

04:13.186 --> 04:14.483
It's my job!

04:36.809 --> 04:39.004
I knew this place was big...

04:39.078 --> 04:41.137
...but I never thought it would be
this huge!

04:41.347 --> 04:42.371
Of course.

04:42.582 --> 04:45.210
This is the only entertainment
in the slums, after all.

04:45.451 --> 04:47.180
We're in the A Block.

04:59.499 --> 05:01.364
The Wind User...

05:02.635 --> 05:06.093
We will now begin the qualifying
rounds for the tournament.

05:06.706 --> 05:10.767
The winner of each block will
proceed to the tournament finals.

05:11.210 --> 05:15.271
May each team do their best
in their search for victory!

05:17.483 --> 05:20.316
Now, let the fight begin!

05:24.590 --> 05:26.455
A Block first match!

05:26.893 --> 05:31.762
Team Rayon versus
Team Muscle 5.

05:33.666 --> 05:34.928
Muscle 5?

05:35.335 --> 05:37.360
What a cheesy name.

05:37.704 --> 05:41.231
By the looks of them, their brains
seem to be made of muscle too.

05:42.108 --> 05:43.302
Don't let them fool you.

05:44.143 --> 05:48.546
They managed to get into the top
eight at the last tournament.

05:49.982 --> 05:51.006
Them?

05:53.152 --> 05:56.952
Do you really think that you
pathetic weaklings...

05:57.023 --> 05:58.991
...can beat my adorable Muscle 5?

05:59.225 --> 06:00.123
Five!

06:01.394 --> 06:02.827
Weaklings?!

06:02.895 --> 06:05.762
We'll see who the weaklings are
once we start fighting.

06:06.299 --> 06:07.527
I suppose.

06:08.067 --> 06:10.365
So, how do you want to fight?

06:10.903 --> 06:13.269
Let's not make this complicated.

06:13.573 --> 06:15.871
Why don't all of you come at us at once!

06:15.942 --> 06:18.376
You sure are confident, kid.

06:19.045 --> 06:21.639
The fight format is Battle Royale.

06:22.215 --> 06:23.705
Begin match!

06:24.417 --> 06:25.679
Finish them off!

06:29.155 --> 06:32.420
Asagi Swordsmanship
Wind Storm!

06:37.397 --> 06:39.695
The winner is Team Rayon!

06:42.668 --> 06:44.499
You're not the only one on this team
you know!

06:56.215 --> 06:57.512
I missed?!

06:57.917 --> 06:59.782
Take it easy, Ginnosuke!

06:59.986 --> 07:03.444
Remember the time when you
defeated a Company assassin!

07:03.556 --> 07:05.490
That doesn't really help now!

07:05.725 --> 07:08.091
You can do it, Ginnosuke!

07:08.161 --> 07:10.857
How can you be having
so much fun?!

07:10.930 --> 07:15.128
If he loses, it might be
your turn to fight, you know!

07:15.201 --> 07:16.429
But, still...!

07:16.569 --> 07:18.434
Nerdy Guy!

07:18.504 --> 07:20.199
Nerdy Guy!

07:20.273 --> 07:23.367
Nerdy Guy!
Come on!

07:23.443 --> 07:25.240
Nerdy Guy!
Once more!

07:25.311 --> 07:27.711
- Don't yell "Nerdy Guy"!
- Nerdy Guy!

07:31.784 --> 07:32.648
Hang on.

07:32.985 --> 07:33.849
The glasses...

07:34.220 --> 07:36.518
The time when I defeated
the assassin...

07:36.589 --> 07:38.318
...I wasn't wearing my glasses.

07:39.392 --> 07:40.381
Maybe...

07:40.860 --> 07:42.350
No, it can't be...

07:49.702 --> 07:52.466
Does taking off your glasses
really change anything?

07:52.538 --> 07:53.596
Don't be ridiculous.

07:53.673 --> 07:56.642
You think a trick like that
is going to work?!

07:59.912 --> 08:03.609
My eyes are blurred and
I can't really see him very well!

08:05.718 --> 08:06.616
Where?!

08:06.686 --> 08:07.983
Where is he?!

08:08.554 --> 08:12.513
Never mind what you see!
Read his presence, Ginnosuke!

08:16.896 --> 08:18.022
Presence...

08:19.499 --> 08:20.625
There!

08:29.475 --> 08:30.601
Over!

08:30.877 --> 08:33.607
The winner is Ginnosuke Isuzu!

08:34.280 --> 08:37.647
Uh, I won...?

08:39.352 --> 08:42.082
Why is it that I'm not
so happy about this?

08:47.627 --> 08:49.754
Level 23, huh?

08:49.829 --> 08:51.262
It's quite terrible.

08:51.531 --> 08:53.226
She's not doing well physically...

08:53.299 --> 08:56.393
...but her mental state
especially is getting worse.

08:56.802 --> 09:00.932
It's difficult to resurrect the Dragons
with the Maiden of Life like this.

09:04.510 --> 09:07.343
I suppose we have to come up
with a plan.

09:09.315 --> 09:10.942
I'm sorry.

09:11.250 --> 09:13.548
Just lighten up a little.

09:13.619 --> 09:16.554
If you try that again,
I'll beat you up!

09:16.822 --> 09:18.881
No more Battle Royale!

09:18.958 --> 09:20.619
All right. All right.

09:20.993 --> 09:23.086
Just don't get so angry.

09:25.998 --> 09:27.158
Rayon?

09:31.737 --> 09:33.671
But at this rate...

09:33.739 --> 09:36.765
...it looks like we can win this
without too much effort.

09:36.842 --> 09:37.467
Yeah.

09:37.743 --> 09:39.233
If they can make the top eight...

09:39.312 --> 09:40.711
...this will be a piece of cake!

09:40.780 --> 09:42.213
No kidding.

09:57.029 --> 09:58.690
Wh-Who are those guys?

09:59.098 --> 10:00.531
They're dangerous.

10:01.000 --> 10:03.366
I can tell just by the way
they carry themselves.

10:04.270 --> 10:05.828
Those piercing eyes.

10:06.439 --> 10:08.236
Who are they?

10:08.774 --> 10:12.676
It just means there'll be some
strong teams we'll have fight, too.

10:12.745 --> 10:15.737
Anyway, we've got to be
on our guard.

10:16.015 --> 10:16.572
Yeah.

10:35.801 --> 10:36.893
What do you want?

10:38.004 --> 10:38.936
Nothing.

10:39.572 --> 10:40.937
Then, go back.

10:41.173 --> 10:43.471
You shouldn't be
worrying about me...

10:43.542 --> 10:45.066
...you should be concentrating
on the fight.

10:46.045 --> 10:46.739
No.

10:49.248 --> 10:51.443
The reason is that
we're no longer strangers.

10:53.686 --> 10:56.052
You're an important member of the team,
right?

11:00.326 --> 11:03.784
Now, if we were to
win the tournament...

11:05.831 --> 11:06.855
Not "if"...

11:08.734 --> 11:11.259
We will definitely win.

11:14.006 --> 11:14.734
Yeah.

11:16.709 --> 11:19.735
And I will for sure
see the Maiden of Life.

11:30.690 --> 11:33.887
Are you going to keep
sulking like that forever?

11:34.293 --> 11:38.525
Over some people that you don't
even know are dead or alive?

11:39.899 --> 11:44.393
It seems like you really like to
play with other people's lives.

11:47.406 --> 11:49.874
So you're capable
of an angry look, huh?

11:50.776 --> 11:52.903
Do you hate me?

11:53.546 --> 11:55.810
Let me tell you something.

11:57.516 --> 12:00.280
Your friends are still alive.

12:02.988 --> 12:05.821
The Wind User is in the slums.

12:10.730 --> 12:14.564
Team Rayon continue to rise up
through the rounds...

12:14.633 --> 12:16.897
...with overwhelming
fighting force!

12:18.104 --> 12:20.368
The winner is Chelsea Rorec!

12:22.908 --> 12:25.308
This sure is hard work.

12:26.979 --> 12:28.742
Fifth qualifying round!

12:28.814 --> 12:34.878
Team Rayon versus
Team Predator!

12:35.421 --> 12:39.084
We will have three individual
one-on-one fights!

12:39.158 --> 12:42.355
Step forward, first player
from each team!

12:42.428 --> 12:44.020
I will be...

12:45.931 --> 12:46.920
...first!

12:48.434 --> 12:49.594
A hybrid-beast?!

12:49.869 --> 12:52.167
This might be a tough one.

12:52.505 --> 12:54.302
All right. I'll start this one off!

12:58.677 --> 13:00.008
Lightning girl!

13:00.479 --> 13:04.438
Sorry but I'm not letting you
take the first shot!

13:05.284 --> 13:09.118
The fight is over as soon as
a player steps out of the ring...

13:09.188 --> 13:13.056
...is dead, unable to fight,
or has given up.

13:14.193 --> 13:15.854
I'm up against a kid, huh?

13:15.928 --> 13:18.624
It looks like I picked
the trump card right off the bat.

13:19.565 --> 13:21.795
You picked the joker, old man.

13:21.934 --> 13:22.696
What?!

13:23.435 --> 13:24.902
First match!

13:24.970 --> 13:25.766
Begin!

13:31.410 --> 13:34.072
I'm going to cut off
your beautiful hair!

13:34.146 --> 13:35.738
Along with your body!

13:37.383 --> 13:38.111
She's gone!

13:38.417 --> 13:39.475
Where did she go?!

13:40.452 --> 13:41.419
Over here.

13:44.723 --> 13:47.123
You're not suited to cutting hair.

13:47.193 --> 13:48.592
You have no style at all.

13:51.030 --> 13:55.990
You might not like the haircut,
but I'll make sure you pay for it!

13:57.770 --> 14:01.672
My muscles are getting stiff
all over, and won't do as I want!

14:02.808 --> 14:05.641
You!
What have you done to me?!

14:07.713 --> 14:09.613
You can't underestimate that kid.

14:09.682 --> 14:11.445
I wondered why she wasn't
using her lightning power.

14:11.517 --> 14:14.543
Instead she used precision
strikes to paralyze his body.

14:15.321 --> 14:19.985
Due to the indisposition of her
opponent, the winner is Shiel Messiah.

14:20.659 --> 14:22.217
That's one win!

14:23.462 --> 14:26.226
I may have missed
the first opponent, but this time...

14:26.298 --> 14:27.663
Forget it.

14:29.368 --> 14:32.769
Hey, hey, hey!
Who am I up against!

14:32.838 --> 14:34.533
Come on up and fight!

14:43.082 --> 14:45.175
Second match! Begin!

14:52.992 --> 14:54.425
What's the matter?

14:54.627 --> 14:55.491
What?

14:55.861 --> 14:59.262
Instead of just standing there,
I'm telling you to come at me.

14:59.498 --> 15:02.092
I don't understand
what you're saying!

15:02.268 --> 15:02.893
Huh?

15:03.535 --> 15:07.266
Could you speak in a language
I can better understand?

15:07.973 --> 15:09.600
I'll get you!

15:12.645 --> 15:13.771
Threads?

15:14.079 --> 15:16.547
If you want to weave,
go elsewhere!

15:28.494 --> 15:29.961
Shalma, you fool!

15:30.262 --> 15:31.058
Shut up!

15:33.098 --> 15:37.057
You see,
I've got spider genes in me.

15:37.336 --> 15:40.203
These threads are
capable of contracting...

15:40.272 --> 15:43.298
...and no human is strong
enough to tear it apart.

15:45.544 --> 15:49.139
I don't have to tear it apart.
All I have to do is freeze it.

15:52.284 --> 15:54.275
The power of ice?

15:55.020 --> 15:57.113
It's time to cool off!

16:00.025 --> 16:00.787
Wha...?!

16:01.126 --> 16:01.922
She floated!

16:02.261 --> 16:03.523
No. Not so.

16:04.330 --> 16:05.058
The thread.

16:05.130 --> 16:08.964
She must've cast that web
during her first attack.

16:13.138 --> 16:16.301
Too bad.
Now your whip can't reach me.

16:16.642 --> 16:17.666
Don't be stupid.

16:20.312 --> 16:23.941
You're mistaken if you think you're
safe because my whip won't reach!

16:27.553 --> 16:28.281
What?!

16:30.556 --> 16:32.251
Dragon Ice!

16:35.294 --> 16:38.286
How can this be?! A whirlwind of ice
in the shape of a dragon?!

16:55.748 --> 16:57.113
That's another.

16:57.483 --> 16:58.472
All right!

16:58.584 --> 16:59.482
That's two down!

16:59.752 --> 17:02.016
One more and we pass
the fifth qualifying round!

17:02.087 --> 17:03.987
Leave the last one to me!

17:05.691 --> 17:07.556
It's my turn next.

17:10.829 --> 17:15.528
You can't have the one who got
you into this not fighting.

17:16.035 --> 17:18.003
What about me?

17:18.170 --> 17:19.660
Poor guy.

17:22.641 --> 17:23.869
Hybrid-beast...

17:24.009 --> 17:26.239
He must be formed from
a predatory animal.

17:26.678 --> 17:29.203
Third match! Begin!

17:38.457 --> 17:41.756
You think you can out-run me.

17:50.169 --> 17:53.661
Sorry, but I'm
under the gun myself.

17:54.373 --> 17:58.833
We can't afford to lose here!

17:59.378 --> 18:00.106
What's that?!

18:02.514 --> 18:03.811
If we're matched in speed...

18:03.882 --> 18:06.442
...I'd say I have an advantage
over you in power.

18:07.019 --> 18:10.250
Under these circumstances,
there's no way you can beat me.

18:10.789 --> 18:12.222
I think not.

18:12.658 --> 18:13.420
What?

18:13.992 --> 18:17.689
You think you've slowed me down
with something like this?

18:18.497 --> 18:20.931
Then give it a try!

18:28.874 --> 18:29.932
She's fast!

18:30.075 --> 18:32.339
Did you see that move, Blondie?

18:32.411 --> 18:35.141
It's completely different from
the first time we saw it.

18:35.981 --> 18:37.039
What's the matter?

18:37.182 --> 18:38.513
Are you already done?

18:39.952 --> 18:42.921
I can't afford to lose...

18:45.224 --> 18:46.919
You're a strong one.

18:48.694 --> 18:50.958
But how about this?

18:55.267 --> 18:57.929
I'll finish you off with the next hit!

18:59.404 --> 19:02.896
A twisted power that goes
against the laws of nature.

19:09.748 --> 19:12.273
What the hybrid-beast desires...

19:12.518 --> 19:13.314
...is...

19:14.520 --> 19:21.119
...freedom from the invisible
fears that lurk in the dark.

19:22.861 --> 19:23.953
That's why...

19:26.198 --> 19:28.257
I cannot lose!

19:35.507 --> 19:37.407
I'll wait only three seconds.

19:39.745 --> 19:41.440
Y-You win.

19:42.080 --> 19:44.344
The winner is Rayon!

19:44.416 --> 19:46.646
Team Rayon wins three
straight matches...

19:46.718 --> 19:48.618
...and wins
the 5th qualifying round.

20:05.170 --> 20:06.364
Rumina...

20:06.838 --> 20:07.998
Chelsea...

20:09.474 --> 20:10.600
Thank goodness.

20:17.015 --> 20:22.009
In each Block, the fights outshine
those of previous tournaments.

20:22.087 --> 20:26.649
Let's see which teams will emerge
to compete in the finals!

20:27.226 --> 20:28.750
It's all going well.

20:29.027 --> 20:31.086
If we win the next one,
we're in the finals!

20:34.466 --> 20:36.127
What about me?

20:44.443 --> 20:49.278
Again, I walk the streets today

20:49.348 --> 20:55.309
As if I have a purpose

20:55.387 --> 21:07.026
Through a city that looks
polished beyond belief

21:08.533 --> 21:19.376
Are you crying?
Those of you with such tiny pasts

21:19.444 --> 21:31.015
When you look up,
you see the sky on a digital screen

21:31.723 --> 21:40.688
The song of the wind...
I climb up the long staircase

21:40.766 --> 21:44.429
I tried to listen

21:44.503 --> 21:52.603
Hold me
The dream that gently wounded me

21:52.678 --> 22:01.643
Has faded away
Please don't cry

22:10.462 --> 22:12.396
Preview

22:12.464 --> 22:13.692
It's been a long while.

22:13.765 --> 22:16.791
I haven't seen you since that day
I betrayed the Company.

22:16.868 --> 22:19.496
No!
This isn't the time to reminisce!

22:19.838 --> 22:22.932
I'm going to defeat you
once again, right here!

22:23.108 --> 22:26.043
Not for the Company
and not for anyone!

22:26.111 --> 22:29.046
I've fought in order
to protect Ruri...

22:29.281 --> 22:31.306
...now and always.

22:31.883 --> 22:34.181
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:34.453 --> 22:36.188
..."Reason - Treacherous Flame."

22:36.188 --> 22:36.922
Reason - Treacherous Flame
..."Reason - Treacherous Flame."

22:36.922 --> 22:40.358
Reason - Treacherous Flame
